stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : ORDER_NEW received
    PENDING --> OPEN : guards passed, sent to broker
    PENDING --> REJECTED : naked-short / kill-switch / CIO HALT
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : pre-broker cancel
    OPEN --> FILLED : broker returns full fill
    OPEN --> PARTIAL : broker returns partial
    OPEN --> CANCELLED : stale > 60s
    OPEN --> REJECTED : limit unreachable / no price
    PARTIAL --> FILLED : remaining qty filled
    PARTIAL --> CANCELLED : timeout
    FILLED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
